   "_id": 27595,
   "ANSWER": "<h3 data-end=\"806\" data-start=\"754\">Step 1: Convert -35 to 8-bit 2&rsquo;s complement</h3>\n\n<p>+35 (Binary) &nbsp; &nbsp; = 00100011<br />\n1&#39;s complement &nbsp; = 11011100<br />\n+1 (Add 1) &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; = 00000001<br />\n-----------------------------<br />\n-35 (2&rsquo;s comp) &nbsp; = 11011101<br />\n&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>Step 2: Convert -60 to 8-bit 2&rsquo;s complement</p>\n\n<p>+60 (Binary) &nbsp; &nbsp; = 00111100<br />\n1&#39;s complement &nbsp; = 11000011<br />\n+1 (Add 1) &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; = 00000001<br />\n-----------------------------<br />\n-60 (2&rsquo;s comp) &nbsp; = 11000100<br />\n&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>Step 3: Binary Addition</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp; 11011101 &nbsp; (-35)<br />\n+ 11000100 &nbsp; (-60)<br />\n-----------<br />\n&nbsp;110000001 &nbsp; (9 bits, discard carry)<br />\n-----------<br />\n&nbsp; 10100001 &nbsp; (8-bit sum)<br />\n&nbsp;</p>\n\n<h4 data-end=\"988\" data-start=\"954\">Step 4: Result Interpretation</h4>\n\n<p>Result = 10100001 (MSB = 1 &rarr; Negative number)</p>\n\n<p>1&#39;s complement &nbsp; = 01011110<br />\n+1 &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; = 00000001<br />\n-----------------------------<br />\nMagnitude &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;= 01011111 &rarr; 95</p>\n\n<p>So, Final Answer = -95<br />\n&nbsp;</p>\n",
